        "text_3NcpiY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The <strong>Lynx OTG Ski Goggles</strong> are the <strong>best over the glasses ski goggles</strong>, featuring a <strong>frameless, spherical lens</strong> for a wide field of view and superior clarity. Designed specifically as <strong>ski goggles you can wear over glasses</strong>, the OTG system ensures all-day comfort without compromising vision.</h3><h3>Easily adapt to any condition with the <strong>magnetic lens system</strong> for quick lens swaps. The dual-layer, anti-fog, and anti-scratch lenses offer <strong>100% UV400 protection</strong>.</h3><h3>With enhanced <strong>ventilation</strong> and a helmet-compatible, adjustable strap, these are the ultimate <strong>ski goggles for glasses</strong> wearers, built for both performance and comfort on every run.</h3>"
          }
